  notes: '17F02 option B sign-off and 17F03 alert. Source: HEARTH_Full_Game_Script_No_Audio_Tags_Native_English.md,
    stable marker 17F02_TerminalSignoff_B. Text is synchronized by Tools/Hearth/Dialogue/Sync
