  lines:
  - lineId: 17F02_TerminalSignoff_B_FieldUnit_001
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.15
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Keep it off?
    holdSeconds: 2.2820754
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a26426602cc0de34ebd0c7a735878555, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F02_TerminalSignoff_B_FieldUnit_002
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: It is in the manual. I've never seen anyone select it.
    holdSeconds: 5.3009434
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 02c7083629fb5444eb6018cbaef5485c, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F02_TerminalSignoff_B_FieldUnit_003
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: You're giving Ben and Claire a chance to work through this without mediation.
      Understood. You're going beyond the standard playbook.
    holdSeconds: 8.697169
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 41114fc906131ec4a8e52ff458f4a586, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F02_TerminalSignoff_B_FieldUnit_004
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: I need to note the risk. The household alarm will remain active throughout
      the observation period, and company monitoring will continue.
    holdSeconds: 9.074528
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 01ee708d133cf46488cd92de6ec0cfa9, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F02_TerminalSignoff_B_FieldUnit_005
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: If Ben and Claire do separate, this disposition could get flagged for post-incident
      review. You'd need to be ready to explain it.
    holdSeconds: 9.451886
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 957a075c705a3eb43bb5d20d72799444, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F02_TerminalSignoff_B_FieldUnit_006
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: The option's allowed. You chose it. I've filed it.
    holdSeconds: 4.5462265
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5a301bf58949eb749b924837b89f2b7e, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F02_TerminalSignoff_B_FieldUnit_007
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: For the next one, Inspector... let's keep things steady.
    holdSeconds: 4.5462265
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b22c4be72cda21a4dad3abc454f820d0, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F02_TerminalSignoff_A_17F02_TerminalSignoff_B_FieldUnit_001
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Next, proceed to 17F-03 for the final inspection on tonight's route.
    holdSeconds: 5.3009434
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 66e8f2982663c3f41ba89a4cbc5bf80d, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F02_TerminalSignoff_A_17F02_TerminalSignoff_B_FieldUnit_002
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Inspector, 17F-03 went offline ten minutes ago. Remote restart failed,
      but the corridor terminal can still read the household file. You'll need emergency
      entry for the repair.
    holdSeconds: 11.338679
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4d7bc016689c61b488f5c63f84a083ee, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  postSequenceDelay: 0.18
